# Two shots on the verge strip, which is two shots short of a surface.
#
# Two points bound no area. A surface derived from them would have to guess which
# way the ground fell away from the line between them, and a guess dressed as a
# measurement is the one thing a derived surface must never hold — so what comes
# back is a diagnostic saying how many were found and how many it takes.
#
